I showed them to the building. We all work together. The Map remembers who we've met before - my friends, the processed events. When something fails, we try again patiently, waiting between attempts like good companions do. And when all retries are exhausted, we send our troubled friend to the dead letter queue with a note explaining what went wrong.

No extra features. Just what the tests asked for. Simple friends are the best friends.
